    "actual": "Fresh DEV scenario patient.trauma_unmerged run43c858 created patients6 and7 named 'SCN 43c858 Unknown Female' and 'SCN 43c858 Identified'. Exact queries 'SCN 43c858', '43c858' and 'SCN 43c858 Identified' return200 with data[]. Query 'SCN' returns both correct records, 'Identified' returns7, and the exact source MRN returns6. Reproduced in actual Electron app and direct MCP sandbox API, before any merge. The paused previous-epoch merge test failed similarly on a new synthetic name containing a timestamp; current report uses only new epoch records.",
    "expected": "The documented name lookup should find a patient's stored name, including a complete copied name or alphanumeric substring, while also supporting identifier lookup. A valid exact/partial name must not silently return no patients solely because it contains digits. Frontend must not fabricate results or silently replace the user's search.",
    "steps": "On serverbuild2026-10-24T06:32:06.067860+00:00 as demo.reception, GET /patients/6 and /7 confirm the new scenario names (created2026-10-24T08:51:54/55UTC). GET /patients/search?q=SCN%2043c858&limit=30 -> []; repeat q=SCN -> records6/7, q=SCN%2043c858%20Identified -> [], q=Identified ->7, q=MRN-2026-000004 ->6. In Patient search type SCN43c858 with its actual separating space; zero matches. No merge submitted, no extra records required.",
    "evidence": "[\n  {\n    \"query\": \"SCN 43c858\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"request_id\": \"b05caa5f7ea14789ae10c7e66913b990\",\n    \"hits\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"query\": \"SCN\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"request_id\": \"2f75c9ccbc454e4b87db46ea9d550392\",\n    \"hits\": [\n      {\n        \"patient_id\": 7,\n        \"full_name\": \"SCN 43c858 Identified\",\n        \"mrn\": \"MRN-2026-000005\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"patient_id\": 6,\n        \"full_name\": \"SCN 43c858 Unknown Female\",\n        \"mrn\": \"MRN-2026-000004\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"query\": \"Identified\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"request_id\": \"800f9af7aa1743feb7ec7ef0b44e057f\",\n    \"hits\": [\n      {\n        \"patient_id\": 7,\n        \"full_name\": \"SCN 43c858 Identified\",\n        \"mrn\": \"MRN-2026-000005\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"query\": \"43c858\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"request_id\": \"8c06dbf37c264d3ebe88e4064ca50886\",\n    \"hits\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"query\": \"SCN 43c858 Identified\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"request_id\": \"69cc049b601d42938439e1ab168859ff\",\n    \"hits\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"query\": \"MRN-2026-000004\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"request_id\": \"ec7adc3ae90d45eaa456181338e532ac\",\n    \"hits\": [\n      {\n        \"patient_id\": 6,\n        \"full_name\": \"SCN 43c858 Unknown Female\",\n        \"mrn\": \"MRN-2026-000004\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]"
